an override YAML 64 with pool 512/min-idle 10; confirm effective pool and `REDIS_ONLY` from logs/metrics. [Task 1][Task 2]\n- Plan file `docs/architecture/IM Redis Batch 并发风险复现与定级方案-20260820.md` uses 500/1500/2500 QPS mixed load with ten-minute steady tiers. P0 requires `cmd5==cmd6==cmd27==cmd7==planned`, zero lost/duplicate/outOfOrder, `ackPending=0`, MQ/Outbox drained. [Task 2]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- “Many Redis calls” is not proof that authorization needs async concurrency -> measure RBatch latency, pool waits, and processor queue/rejections first. [Task 1]\n- Do not assume YAML 64 pool or inevitable ordinary-command misalignment; do not broadly replace Batch or split authorization into concurrent GETs before reproduction. [Task 1][Task 2]\n\n# Task Group: Codex archived-session analysis and PowerShell variable-stripping workaround\nscope: Group and summarize archived Codex sessions in Chinese, while avoiding the local inline PowerShell `$`-variable execution trap.\napplies_to: cwd=C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents; reuse_rule=archive IDs, titles, statuses, and dates are a historical snapshot; the archive-query API and local shell workaround are reusable.\n\n## Task 1: Analyze current Codex archived sessions\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-20T09-33-20-ADpE-analyze_archived_codex_sessions_powershell_var_trap.md (cwd=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\20\\rollout-2026-08-20T17-33-20-01a01e84-9526-79f2-8463-9cbc9b87c5b2.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-20T09:36:42+00:00, thread_id=01a01e84-9526-79f2-8463-9cbc9b87c5b2, uncertain: structured analysis delivered; age estimates were not precisely calculated)\n\n### keywords\n\n- list_archived_threads, set_thread_archived, archived_sessions, codex_app, PowerShell, $ 变量剥离, Missing variable name after foreach, FromUnixTimeSeconds\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when the user says “分析我目前codex归档的会话” -> directly execute the man