ked until DBA runs DDL, `10.168.1.233:3306` is reachable, file service provides copy/signing, six samples are finalized, and integration/load runs complete. [Task 1]\n- Migration implementation: `im.collection.enabled=true`, retain `consumer-enabled=true`, and keep `media-copy-enabled=false` until the file-service contract exists. Mark `GroupMsgCollectController` / service and its OpenAPI operations deprecated, and point API docs to `消息收藏-服务端API契约.md`. Commits recorded: `749a97df7`, `70e199f26`. [Task 2]\n- `CollectionSnapshotBuilder.looksLikeUrl` must treat a relative objectKey containing `/` plus a file extension as a media reference; otherwise real IM media tasks can empty-spin SUCCESS with no `mediaList`. `mediaMessageExtractsRelativeObjectKey` covers this. [Task 2]\n- IM dev is read/write split: writes on `10.168.1.233`, reads on `10.168.1.232`. `TB_USER_SESSION_INDEX_*` has no `CREATE_TIME` or `UPDATE_TIME`; remove `UPDATE_TIME = NOW()` from `batchUpsertSessionIndex` rather than searching for a missing migration. Fix committed as `212d2773e` (relative objectKey) and `0f3f63a94` (UPDATE_TIME). [Task 2]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Never use login success, sender stats, or MQ drain as capacity proof: require `cmd5=cmd6=cmd27=cmd7`, `ackPending=0`, and MQ/Outbox tail completion. [Task 1]\n- Delete/reconciliation can race Worker `PENDING->READY`: lock the current row with `SELECT ... FOR UPDATE`, then release quota based on latest state. Scan text/location timeouts (5s) separately from media (60s) so slow media does not starve recovery. [Task 1]\n- A `{\"code\":404,\"msg\":\"资源不存在\"}` response can be the downstream `GlobalExceptionHandler` (HTTP 200), not the gateway itself. Grep `资源不存在`, then compare direct complete `/v1/im/...` to the same instance's stripped path; if only stripped fails, align StripPrefix. Do not hide DB errors with `2>$null`; inspect `SHOW COLUMNS` and the read/write topology first. [Task 1][Task 2]\n\n# Task Group: Windows Cl