ious_response_id\n\n## Task 3: Move image generation to official web ChatGPT with a handoff skill\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-14T02-09-38-JDVn-clash_opencodex_traffic_web_gpt_image_handoff_skill.md (cwd=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\14\\rollout-2026-08-14T10-09-38-019ffe08-3347-7b52-8094-015eaf08d979.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-19T06:10:44+00:00, thread_id=019ffe08-3347-7b52-8094-015eaf08d979, success: handoff skill, project rule, and vision-sidecar disablement applied)\n\n### keywords\n\n- web-gpt-image-handoff, 官方网页ChatGPT, visionSidecar.enabled, AGENTS.md, image_gen, copy-ready handoff sheet, 10-per-batch\n\n## Task 4: Diagnose OpenCodex 401 account-pool and recurring 400 errors\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-14T02-20-26-xprg-opencodex_bun_proxy_error_diagnostics_401_oom_tool_state.md (cwd=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\08\\14\\rollout-2026-08-14T10-20-26-019ffe12-1640-76a0-a32f-77d9a287cb76.jsonl, updated_at=2026-09-01T01:38:59+00:00, thread_id=019ffe12-1640-76a0-a32f-77d9a287cb76, success: root causes separated and revalidated)\n\n### keywords\n\n- CodexPoolAuthenticationError, 401 Unauthorized, chatgpt.com, wham/usage, usage.jsonl, service.log, Invalid JSON body, RangeError: Out of memory, Bun 1.3.14, Duplicate tool output for call_id, prompt_cache_retention, prompt_cache_options, Cloudflare challenge\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when the user says “我一直开的规则模式啊，你看看是不是配置有问题” -> do not start by blaming an accidental global-mode switch; read live `/configs`, `/rules`, and the active profile binding before concluding. [Task 1]\n- when the user asks “怎么去APP界面里面查询” -> provide a self-recheck path as well as the diagnosis. [Task 1]\n- when the user says “做调整” / “帮我改了” after a diagnosed, reversible fix -> apply it and verify the runtime result instead of stopping at advice. [Task 1][Task 2]\n- when the user says “后面出图我只想用网页版本的gpt，给我方案” and “把这个落成skill” -> for AIGC image generation/edits, produce copy-ready prompt handoff sheets for official web ChatGPT; do not initiate image tools, browser automation, or bulk media upload through Codex/OpenCodex. [Task 3]\n- when troubleshooting this machine, the user asks in Chinese why 401 persists despite free quota -> answer in Chinese and distinguish credential state, ChatGPT reachability, and quota up front. [Task 4]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n\n- Start with Clash `GET /configs`, `/proxies`, `/connections`, `/version`, and `/rules` at `http://127.0.0.1:9097`. A terminal `MATCH,节点选择` in rule mode sends all non-domestic/unmatched traffic to the proxy: “局部” is domestic/allowlist routing, not only explicitly named sites. Use `connections[].chains` to distinguish DIRECT from a node. [Task 1]\n- To change a subscription's rules, first locate the active profile in `profiles.yaml` and its `option.rules` binding. On this machine the effective file is `profiles/rUwK2myX1tfT.yaml`; adding `DOMAIN-SUFFIX,deepseek.com,DIRECT` and `GEOSITE,cn,DIRECT` to its `prepend` then restarting `clash-verge.exe` put GeoSite cn into live `/rules`. Global `Merge.yaml`, profile Merge `prepend-rules`, and core-only restart did not reliably rebuild the runtime configuration. [Task 1]\n- OpenNetMeter requires admin installation and records Clash-forwarded connections as `verge-mihomo`; query its `OpenNetMeter.sqlite` `ProcessDate` joins for daily per-process totals, then use Clash `/connections` plus `metadata.sourcePort` -> `Get-NetTCPConnection -LocalPort <port>` -> process lookup to identify the real client. [Task 1]\n- Codex is routed through OpenCodex by `openai_base_url = \"http://127.0.0.1:10100/v1\"`. OpenCodex expands `previous_response_id` into full local input (`expandPreviousResponseInput`); the ChatGPT backend rejects that continuation ID, so it repeatedly uploads full history. `contextCapValue` and every `providerContextCaps` in `C:\\Users\\79873\\.opencodex\\config.json` cap replay tokens, not network bytes; lowering 950000 to 200000 reduced but did not eliminate traffic. [Task 2]\n- For high-frequency image/story work through OpenCodex, start a new Codex task after a completed storyboard/chapter and send reference images only when needed; long repeated sessions replay text and visual context. Web ChatGPT does not have the same client-side replay amplification because its history stays server-side. [Task 2]\n- The durable image-work path is three layers: project `AGENTS.md` rule, global `web-gpt-image-handoff` skill, and `visionSidecar.enabled=false`. The handoff includes per-frame positive prompt, locks, negatives, filename, and 10-image acceptance checklist; user generates/downloads manually in web ChatGPT. [Task 3]\n- For this proxy, `C:\\Users\\79873\\.opencodex\\usage.jsonl` is the fast status/model ledger and `service.log` is the error root-cause source. A 401 `CodexPoolAuthenticationError` means OpenCodex selected no usable account; first run account-state/WHAM checks and probe `chatgpt.com` via Clash. An active free account with remaining quota still fails when reachability is `000`; WHAM 200/401 shows the API is reachable. Invoke `ocx.ps1` through `powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File ...` if execution policy blocks the shim. [Task 4]\n- Here `Invalid JSON body` was Bun request decoding after `RangeError: Out of memory`, not user JSON. Grep `service.log` for `request body decode/parse failed|panic\\(|Bun has crashed`; a ~950k context cap and giant sessions drove Bun 1.3.14 crashes. Start a new session, lower context caps to roughly 128k-256k, restart/upgrade OpenCodex, then monitor RSS. [Task 4]\n- `Duplicate tool output for call_id` points to client/proxy replay of a damaged session: stop retrying it, use a new task, then restart/upgrade only if new tasks fail. `prompt_cache_retention is not supported on this model` is an auto-injected deprecated parameter; do not add it manually—upgrade the client to use `prompt_cache_options.ttl`. A Cloudflare challenge HTML/403 from the homepage reflects the exit IP, not account quota; switch node/use a real browser and test the actual WHAM endpoint. [Task 4]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Editing global `Merge.yaml` and profile Merge before checking `profiles.yaml` wasted two attempts because neither file was compiled into live `/rules`; discover the bound custom-rule file first, then restart the Clash Verge application and verify `/rules`. [Task 1]\n- `verge-mihomo.exe -t -f clash-verge.yaml` can fail with `can't download MMDB: context deadline exceeded` when offline GeoIP/MMDB is absent; that does not prove a rule syntax failure when the running core already has the data. Validate live `/rules` instead. [Task 1]\n- OpenNetMeter alone cannot distinguish direct from proxy traffic because it attributes both forwarded traffic to `verge-mihomo`; do not stop at its process name—correlate the high-upload connection's source port and Clash chain. [Task 1]\n- A 200k replay cap is not a byte cap: multiple concurrent 200k+ context tasks can still consume GBs. For image/story runs, switching the image step away from OpenCodex is the actual traffic-control pivot. [Task 2][Task 3]\n- Do not blame an expired subscription based only on `active_until`; this was initially wrong. Check `ocx account list --json --all` and live WHAM before attributing a 401 to account state. [Task 4]\n\n# Task Group: aigc-dali-cat / Douyin operations, subtitle review, topic research, and 05d regeneration\nscope: Browser-dependent Douyin metrics collection, subtitle QA, topic research boundaries, K1 comparison routing, and release-image validation for the story-production pipeline.\napplies_to: cwd=D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat; reuse_rule=follow current `standards/制作规范_正式版.md` and episode evidence; browser-config state and individual assets are time-specific.\n\n## Task 1: Handle browser-blocked Douyin data collection and complete S1 subtitle review\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-12T05-59-04-OU27-douyin_data_browser_blocked_jsrepl_false_and_s1_subtitle_rev.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\archived_sessions\\rollout-2026-08-12T13-59-05-019ff48d-887c-73f3-98fc-f6b1b8cc22e3.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-14T14:59:51+00:00, thread_id=019ff48d-887c-73f3-98fc-f6b1b8cc22e3, mixed: collection blocked; S1 subtitle review passed 20/20)\n\n### keywords\n\n- 抖音创作者中心, js_repl=false, Browser use requires privileged node_repl capabilities, browser-client.mjs, config.toml, control-chrome, S1_墨脱, 带字幕评审, 数据验收报告\n\n## Task 2: Research Chang'e topic, route K1 comparison, and validate 05d release images\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-13T09-17-02-jAN1-shenshi_chang_e_topic_k1_comparison_05d_image_regen.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\yeqian\\aigc-dali-cat, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\archived_sessions\\rollout-2026-08-13T17-17-02-019ffa69-24cd-7022-848f-1622e2a0c8e7.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-14T10:46:12+00:00, thread_id=019ffa69-24cd-7022-848f-1622e2a0c8e7, partial: Chang'e topic approved; K1 scoring output missing; 05d has recorded drift)\n\n### keywords\n\n- 神尸系列, 嫦娥, 不要提到考古队, 对比K1泥人, 05d_神尸地图_嫦娥, 图10, 图11, 图17, 橙色反光条, 错位倒影, 现实侵入式伪纪录片\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when the user specifies “[@chrome] 用这个查看”, first check whether Chrome control is enabled; do not repeatedly retry privileged browser paths after confirming `js_repl=false`. [Task 1]\n- for subtitles, “尽量不要放在右边、顶部和底部，不要遮挡主要信息” -> default to mid-left empty space, preserve the subject, and check every character against storyboard text. [Task 1]\n- for 神尸系列, the user said “不要提到考古队了” and “网上找找，参考” -> avoid archaeology-team framing and actively research comparable works while retaining a distinct hook. [Task 2]\n- for `对比打分`, require an explicit directory and target item (for example “对比K1泥人”) before scoring. [Task 2]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n\n- First run `Select-String -Path \"$env:USERPROFILE\\.codex\\config.toml\" -Pattern \"js_repl\"`. If false, Chrome control cannot expose privileged `mcp__node_repl__js`; `browser-client.mjs` fails with `Browser use requires privileged node_repl capabilities`. Stop retries; Playwright without a Douyin login state cannot replace it. [Task 1]\n- `standards/数据验收报告.md` is the data-acceptance source. Keep views, likes, comments, favorites, shares, follows, average browse images, and swipe-away rate separate; do not use summary values as 24h/48h metrics. [Task 1]\n- S1's 20 subtitle images and `09_神话遗址_S1_墨脱_带字幕评审_V1.0.md` passed 20/20. Subtitle QA must catch generated wrong characters, as in 小尸镇在 / 遗蜕 / 涌过去. [Task 1]\n- The Chang'e topic may borrow only broad “moon-back relic / myth corpse / contact-driven collapse” structure. Avoid the named 749局 hook set “集体自杀+同一句遗言+哥哥队长”; distinguish via distance mutation and the myth-corpse reveal. `references/zh-CN.md` / `en-US.md` are absent—use `standards/制作规范_正式版.md` as authority. [Task 2]\n- 05d's 20 release images passed file/timecode/subtitle continuity checks, but 图10's blue spacesuit stripe conflicts with the orange-reflective-stripe rule and 图01's reflection remains centered rather than misaligned. Keep these as open drift; thumbnail subtlety is not acceptance. [Task 2]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Once `js_repl=false` is confirmed, do not repeat direct import/MCP-handshake/proxy-source experiments already documented as blocked. [Task 1]\n- A K1 comparison inventory was cut off before a final scoring table: do not assert a final comparison score when the deliverable is absent. [Task 2]\n\n# Task Group: Windows Codex desktop responsiveness, OpenCodex routing, and safe session archiving\nscope: Diagnose Codex UI/task-opening slowness versus model-response delay; safely reduce active-session index pressure without