d/numbering.xml, PAGE, NUMPAGES, $OutputEncoding\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when the user asks in Chinese \"给我写一份转正申请\" through the documents plugin -> deliver a real, formal, directly fillable Chinese `.docx`, not only prose or an outline. [Task 1]\n- for workplace documents without confirmed personal facts, use fields such as `【姓名】` and `【部门】` and do not turn unfinished verification into a production/completed claim. [Task 1]\n\n## Reusable knowledge\n\n- The successful format used `standard_business_brief`: A4, Microsoft YaHei, 1.25 body line spacing, centered title, a basic-information table, five body sections, signature area, independent numbered accomplishments/shortcomings, and a PAGE/NUMPAGES footer. [Task 1]\n- The local documents package was `C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\plugins\\cache\\openai-primary-runtime\\documents\\26.805.11740\\skills\\documents`; its `table_geometry.py`, `heading_audit.py`, `style_lint.py`, and `a11y_audit.py` plus XML review verified the final document. `table_geometry.py <docx>` takes no `--check` flag. [Task 1]\n- `List Number` in python-docx does not itself create body `numPr`; real numbering requires `abstractNum`/`num` in `word/numbering.xml` and `w:numPr/w:numId` on paragraphs. For table width or header metadata, remove existing XML elements before appending replacements; duplicated `w:tblW`/`w:tcW` leaves stale values and breaks geometry checks. [Task 1]\n- If LibreOffice/`soffice` is unavailable, use the skill's structural/a11y/style audits and XML review as a fallback, but explicitly state that render-level, page-by-page visual QA was not performed. [Task 1]\n\n## Failures and how to do differently\n\n- Piping Python through PowerShell with Chinese paths caused `PackageNotFoundError: Package not found at 'C:\\\\Users\\\\79873\\\\Documents\\\\????.docx'` -> set `$OutputEncoding = [System.Text.UTF8Encoding]::new()` before `| & $py -`. [Task 1]\n- PAGE/NUMPAGES fields may lack cached displayed values even though Word recalcul