POOL, chatDbAsync, Outbox GAP, executor-pool-size\n\n## Task 9: Compare dev-im-merge and dev-imtest single-chat optimizations\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-07T08-18-48-u3KQ-compare_dev_im_merge_dev_imtest_single_chat_optimizations.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\archived_sessions\\rollout-2026-08-07T16-18-48-019fdb4d-aa58-7f90-a383-bc18159092f4.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-07T08:53:28+00:00, thread_id=019fdb4d-aa58-7f90-a383-bc18159092f4, success: static branch comparison and production-safe priority list; no runtime benchmark)\n\n### keywords\n\n- dev-im-merge, dev-imtest, d7037b97bc77da196b47ef3130eaeda83a956575, JMeter, SingleChatPerformanceObserver, RBatch, AbortPolicy, MessageConsumer, offline queue, DLQ, async DB, CPU affinity\n\n## Task 10: Verify the post-refactor single-chat chain and assess 2000 QPS readiness\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-08-07T02-35-59-YZSP-im_single_chat_chain_and_2000_qps_capacity_analysis.md (cwd=\\\\?\\D:\\workspace\\YeQianWorkSpace\\youpu\\yopu-cloud-platform, rollout_path=C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\archived_sessions\\rollout-2026-08-07T10-35-59-019fda13-d193-7921-9f3a-bdc8ddee8b0b.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-07T03:16:13+00:00, thread_id=019fda13-d193-7921-9f3a-bdc8ddee8b0b, partial: chain verified; 2000 QPS not strictly accepted)\n\n### keywords\n\n- IMHandler, messageProcessor, SingleChatPersistenceTask, chatDbAsyncExecutor, saveSingleMessage, SingleChatSessionOutboxPublisher, SessionIndexPartitionDispatcher, CallerRunsPolicy, clientMsgId, 2000-QPS, SelectorManager\n\n## User preferences\n\n- when the user asked to rerun and first check whether the current pre message queue still has backlog -> inspect relevant RabbitMQ Push, ACK/offline, and business queues read-only; establish a clear baseline before applying load. [Task 3]\n- when the user required “用户数量可配置、M秒发送N条可配置” -> expose workload controls as