ypes, and filter reflection with `$_.IsGenericMethod`. Use `TryCreateFromUserProfileLanguages()` instead of an unloaded `Windows.Globalization.Language`. [Task 1]\n- Small dark-image numerals were inconsistent across OCR/enhancement attempts. If the number drives a cost decision, cross-check multiple enhancements and manually inspect, or get source/platform data; do not report a single OCR result as exact. Bound any `rg` search to likely app directories and a timeout—recursing through `D:\\soft`/AppData was slow and irrelevant. [Task 1]\n\n# Task Group: Windows Fiddler Classic and MEmu HTTP/WebSocket capture setup\nscope: Configure both local MEmu instances for Fiddler Classic HTTP/HTTPS capture, maintain reboot recovery, and distinguish direct IM WebSocket traffic from observed Fiddler frames.\napplies_to: cwd=C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents; reuse_rule=local executable paths, ADB serials, certificates, UI state, and NAT/host routing are machine/session-specific; do not call WebSocket capture complete without a fresh `101 Switching Protocols` session and frames.\n\n## Task 1: Configure Fiddler Classic and MEmu proxy/HTTPS capture\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-07-29T01-44-35-GAwl-fiddler_memu_android_proxy_cert_capture_setup.md (cwd=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\Documents, rollout_path=\\\\?\\C:\\Users\\79873\\.codex\\sessions\\2026\\07\\29\\rollout-2026-07-29T09-44-35-019fab8b-84a0-7430-9ebe-eda54efd9ea5.jsonl, updated_at=2026-08-27T02:28:51+00:00, thread_id=019fab8b-84a0-7430-9ebe-eda54efd9ea5, success: Fiddler Classic on 8866 and both VM HTTP/HTTPS proxy paths verified)\n\n### keywords\n\n- Fiddler Classic, Fiddler Everywhere, MEmu, adb.exe, memuc.exe, 127.0.0.1:21503, 127.0.0.1:21513, 10.0.2.2:8866, 269953fb.0, AllowRemote, CaptureCONNECT\n\n## Task 2: Use a narrow host allowlist and reversible proxy on/off workflow\n\n### rollout_summary_files\n\n- rollout_summaries/2026-07-29T01-44-35-GAwl-fiddler_memu_android_proxy_cert_capture_setup.md (cwd